    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401160/extras/4d7f89abf4dee764570b00aed4974dbf.webp?t=1745018098\" width=659 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401160/extras/c2aaabeadf863b73eead7bad8b070e9c.poster.avif?t=1745018098\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401160/extras/c2aaabeadf863b73eead7bad8b070e9c.webm?t=1745018098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401160/extras/c2aaabeadf863b73eead7bad8b070e9c.mp4?t=1745018098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Highly configurable time based turns make the gameplay super engaging</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401160/extras/eb52146e6fb0595648ab4967a429d6b5.webp?t=1745018098\" width=610 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401160/extras/e195ba3b7d47d165b5eb6cac4d7c9d13.poster.avif?t=1745018098\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401160/extras/e195ba3b7d47d165b5eb6cac4d7c9d13.webm?t=1745018098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401160/extras/e195ba3b7d47d165b5eb6cac4d7c9d13.mp4?t=1745018098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Choose from a variety of modules to customize both the deck and hull layer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stop the Ceaseless from Spreading!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unknown element has been unleashed upon space and its spread causes everything it consumes to cease!<br>It's your job to explore the universe while visiting structures and investigating signals to make your starship as powerful as you can make it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you feel ready or the spread of the Ceaseless becomes too great, locate and defeat the\u00a0perpetrator of the end of universe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression:</strong>\u00a0Build up your ship as you obtain new resources, discover new blueprints for parts, and extract up to 5 modules to give your ship synergistic buffs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Universe:</strong> Traverse an endless procedurally generated universe,  composed of unique combinations of environments that each have different risks and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate Signals:</strong>\u00a0Your radars will pick up random signals ranging from harmless mining operations to deadly ambushes. Assess these signals and decide if they are worth your resources.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>Progress updates on my YouTube channel at Ink4112 or on the sidebar --&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401160/extras/b60ff883c84aae9b9c6082e2d307f12d.webp?t=1745018098\" width=609 height=31 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401160/extras/4d7f89abf4dee764570b00aed4974dbf.webp?t=1745018098\" width=659 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401160/extras/c2aaabeadf863b73eead7bad8b070e9c.poster.avif?t=1745018098\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401160/extras/c2aaabeadf863b73eead7bad8b070e9c.webm?t=1745018098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401160/extras/c2aaabeadf863b73eead7bad8b070e9c.mp4?t=1745018098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Highly configurable time based turns make the gameplay super engaging</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401160/extras/eb52146e6fb0595648ab4967a429d6b5.webp?t=1745018098\" width=610 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401160/extras/e195ba3b7d47d165b5eb6cac4d7c9d13.poster.avif?t=1745018098\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401160/extras/e195ba3b7d47d165b5eb6cac4d7c9d13.webm?t=1745018098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401160/extras/e195ba3b7d47d165b5eb6cac4d7c9d13.mp4?t=1745018098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Choose from a variety of modules to customize both the deck and hull layer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stop the Ceaseless from Spreading!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unknown element has been unleashed upon space and its spread causes everything it consumes to cease!<br>It's your job to explore the universe while visiting structures and investigating signals to make your starship as powerful as you can make it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you feel ready or the spread of the Ceaseless becomes too great, locate and defeat the\u00a0perpetrator of the end of universe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression:</strong>\u00a0Build up your ship as you obtain new resources, discover new blueprints for parts, and extract up to 5 modules to give your ship synergistic buffs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Universe:</strong> Traverse an endless procedurally generated universe,  composed of unique combinations of environments that each have different risks and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate Signals:</strong>\u00a0Your radars will pick up random signals ranging from harmless mining operations to deadly ambushes. Assess these signals and decide if they are worth your resources.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>Progress updates on my YouTube channel at Ink4112 or on the sidebar --&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401160/extras/b60ff883c84aae9b9c6082e2d307f12d.webp?t=1745018098\" width=609 height=31 /></span></p></li></ul>",
